{
  "id": "nce2-l26",
  "title": "Lesson 26: The Best Art Critics",
  "audio": "/audio/nce2/26－The Best Art Critics.mp3",
  "image": "/images/nce2/l26/scene1.png",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "intro_1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Lesson 26",
      "translation": "第26课",
      "startTime": 0.5,
      "endTime": 2.01
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The Best Art Critics",
      "translation": "最佳艺术评论家",
      "startTime": 2.51,
      "endTime": 5.01
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
      "translation": "听录音，然后回答问题。",
      "startTime": 5.51,
      "endTime": 10.49
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Who is the student's best critic?",
      "translation": "谁是这个学生最好的评论家？",
      "startTime": 10.99,
      "endTime": 15.47
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "I am an art student and I paint a lot of pictures.",
      "translation": "我是个学艺术的学生，画了很多画。",
      "startTime": 15.97,
      "endTime": 20.95
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_6",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Many people pretend that they understand modern art.",
      "translation": "很多人假装他们懂现代艺术。",
      "startTime": 21.45,
      "endTime": 25.82
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_7",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "They always tell you what a picture is 'about'.",
      "translation": "他们总是告诉你一幅画'讲的是什么'。",
      "startTime": 26.32,
      "endTime": 30.05
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Of course, many pictures are not 'about' anything.",
      "translation": "当然，很多画什么也不'讲'。",
      "startTime": 30.55,
      "endTime": 34.8,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/scene1.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "They are just pretty patterns.",
      "translation": "它们只是好看的图案。",
      "startTime": 35.3,
      "endTime": 37.61,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/scene1.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "We like them in the same way that we like pretty curtain material.",
      "translation": "我们喜欢它们就像我们喜欢漂亮的窗帘布一样。",
      "startTime": 38.11,
      "endTime": 43.68,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/scene1.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "I think that young children often appreciate modern pictures better than anyone else.",
      "translation": "我认为小孩子往往比任何人都更能欣赏现代画。",
      "startTime": 44.18,
      "endTime": 51.51,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/scene1.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "They notice more.",
      "translation": "他们观察得更多。",
      "startTime": 52.01,
      "endTime": 53.77,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/critic_explaining.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "My sister is only seven, but she always tells me whether my pictures are good or not.",
      "translation": "我的妹妹只有7岁，但她总是告诉我她是否喜欢我的画。",
      "startTime": 54.27,
      "endTime": 62.17,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/critic_explaining.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "She came into my room yesterday.",
      "translation": "她昨天来到我的房间。",
      "startTime": 62.67,
      "endTime": 65.44,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/critic_explaining.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "'What are you doing?' she asked.",
      "translation": "'你在干什么？'她问。",
      "startTime": 65.94,
      "endTime": 68.86,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/critic_explaining.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "'I'm hanging this picture on the wall,' I answered. 'It's a new one. Do you like it?' She looked at it critically for a moment.",
      "translation": "'我正把这幅画挂到墙上，'我回答说。'这是一幅新画。你喜欢吗？'她用挑剔的眼光看了一会儿。",
      "startTime": 69.36,
      "endTime": 80.57,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/critic_explaining.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "'It's all right,' she said, 'but isn't it upside down?' I looked at it again.",
      "translation": "'还可以，'她说，'但它是不是挂倒了？'我又看了看这幅画。",
      "startTime": 81.07,
      "endTime": 88.47,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/child_painting.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "She was right! It was!",
      "translation": "她说得对！确实是倒挂着的！",
      "startTime": 88.97,
      "endTime": 93.97,
      "image": "/images/nce2/l26/child_painting.png"
    }
  ]
}